			"notes": "- Public API for other mods: `gg.earu.coh.api.ChatOverHead` reports who is typing and whose message is still popped up, keyed by UUID, with listeners for every transition. Fabric mirrors them on `CohEvents.STATE_CHANGE`, Forge posts `ChatStateChangedEvent`.\n- Forge: chat bubbles now render. The mixin config was never registered, so every display spawn failed.\n- Forge: chat messages are handled on the server thread instead of the chat decorator's worker thread."
